{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/4e50030aacb07156e5b8c2c354103f2b.poster.avif?t=1772040455\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/4e50030aacb07156e5b8c2c354103f2b.webm?t=1772040455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/4e50030aacb07156e5b8c2c354103f2b.mp4?t=1772040455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the shadow of an abandoned keep\u00a0lies the all-but-forgotten village of Weepstone. Once a thriving settlement, its fields now stand barren, and its people desperate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byron, the Lord of Weepstone, has taken ill, his dreams plagued with visions of unholy rituals and occult symbols. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unlikely commonfolk are tasked to explore the keep to discover the mysterious source of Byron's suffering. There are no heroes here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Secret of Weepstone is a black-and-white, dungeon crawling love letter to old school role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/f7dfdacdb8ebdca0a08485846d72f1c8.poster.avif?t=1772040455\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/f7dfdacdb8ebdca0a08485846d72f1c8.webm?t=1772040455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/extras/f7dfdacdb8ebdca0a08485846d72f1c8.mp4?t=1772040455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gameplay heavily inspired by classic D&amp;D:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice for skill checks and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the dangerous puzzles guarding each dungeon\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a wide variety of creatures through hand-drawn black and white art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters as you find treasure and triumph in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your party with the new weapons and equipment you loot on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace death and gain unique &quot;Mortal Favors&quot; whenever characters die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to 8 members from common villagers to battle-worn adventurers, recruiting new characters along the way.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702100?t=1772040455","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702100?t=1772040455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/3a71f18373b7b5f45b81a65f25d189ba9b657338/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772040455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/3a71f18373b7b5f45b81a65f25d189ba9b657338/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772040455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes fantasy violence, mild black and white gore, and occasional crude or profane language."},"demos":[{"appid":3876150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steams