=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice for skill checks and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the dangerous puzzles guarding each dungeon\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a wide variety of creatures through hand-drawn black and white art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters as you find treasure and triumph in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit your party with the new weapons and equipment you loot on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace death and gain unique &quot;Mortal Favors&quot; whenever characters die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to 8 members from common villagers to battle-worn adventurers, recruiting new characters along the way.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Talesworth Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702100/3e8cc9d1732fbb9fdd56515778cda01c24b7d8cf/header.jpg?t=1772040455","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702100/1317116045/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761061914/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761239694","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702100/1317116045/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761061914/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761239694","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702100/1317116045/d55884d0c40129c2095d8961dacf015eaf89dc2d/1761061914/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761239694","id":257220567,"name":"Demo Out Now","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220567/75fceedc68d110d2b1978c68ca76c94537f8d35b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761239694"}],"name":"The Secret of Weepstone","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u